menu "C6 RF Coexistence Test"

config C6_RF_TEST_ENABLED
    bool "Enable C6 RF coexistence test framework (P4 host side)"
    default n
    help
        Compile the c6_rf_test component's active implementation.
        Keep n for the factory firmware; enable explicitly in CI as a
        compile gate and on-device during the flashing window.

config C6_RF_TEST_ENABLE_BLE
    bool "Include BLE scan test path"
    depends on C6_RF_TEST_ENABLED
    default n
    help
        Requires esp_hosted >= 2.x with host BT feature
        (CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_HOST_FEAT_BT) and a rebuilt C6 coprocessor
        firmware with CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_CP_FEAT_BT — do in the flashing
        window only.

endmenu
